<xml xmlns="https://developers.google.com/blockly/xml"><block type="program_start" id="hello-start" x="80" y="60"><comment pinned="false" h="70" w="300">This part of the program runs only once when the board is powered on or restarted.</comment><next><block type="text_print" id="hello-print"><comment pinned="false" h="72" w="334">Prints a greeting to the REPL console (at the bottom of the screen). You will see the console output after connecting the board to ESP IDE.</comment><value name="TEXT"><shadow type="text" id="hello-text"><field name="TEXT">Hello, board!</field></shadow></value></block></next></block><block type="program_loop" id="hello-loop" x="80" y="166"><comment pinned="false" h="80" w="320">The blocks inside run repeatedly in an endless loop. This makes the LED turn on and off repeatedly.</comment><statement name="DO"><block type="gpio_set" id="hello-led-on"><comment pinned="false" h="87" w="467">Sets the selected pin to logic 1 (3.3 V), turning the LED on.
Connect the LED through a current-limiting resistor (160R to 500R) between the selected pin and GND.</comment><value name="pin"><shadow type="math_number" id="hello-pin-on"><field name="NUM">1</field></shadow></value><value name="value"><shadow type="math_number" id="hello-value-on"><field name="NUM">1</field></shadow></value><next><block type="utime.delay" id="hello-wait-on"><field name="SCALE">sleep_ms</field><comment pinned="false" h="55" w="260">Waits 500 ms, or half a second.</comment><value name="TIME"><shadow type="math_number" id="hello-time-on"><field name="NUM">500</field></shadow></value><next><block type="gpio_set" id="hello-led-off"><comment pinned="false" h="65" w="300">Sets the selected pin to logic 0 (0 V), turning the LED off.</comment><value name="pin"><shadow type="math_number" id="hello-pin-off"><field name="NUM">1</field></shadow></value><value name="value"><shadow type="math_number" id="hello-value-off"><field name="NUM">0</field></shadow></value><next><block type="utime.delay" id="hello-wait-off"><field name="SCALE">sleep_ms</field><comment pinned="false" h="65" w="300">Waits half a second before turning the LED on again.</comment><value name="TIME"><shadow type="math_number" id="hello-time-off"><field name="NUM">500</field></shadow></value></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></statement></block>
  <!--ESPIDE_EXTENSIONS_BEGIN-->
eyJ2ZXJzaW9uIjoxLCJwcm9jZXNzb3IiOiJTaW11bGF0b3IiLCJleHRlbnNpb25zIjpbXX0=
<!--ESPIDE_EXTENSIONS_END-->
</xml>